    "table_title": "Table 1a. Schedule of Non-laboratory Assessments",
    "table_purpose": "Primary anchor schedule: non-laboratory assessments across screening and study days -2 to 55. Printed under the overall heading 'Table 1. Schedule of Assessments' together with Table 1b (laboratory) and Table 1c (pharmacokinetic).",
    "page_start": 32,
    "page_end": 33,
    "notes": "Classified main_soa: rows are procedures performed on subjects and this is the primary/anchor grid of the Table 1 set. Two header rows: a merged 'Study Visit (Day)' banner spanning columns 2-21, and the day-number row. The day number and its '(HD)' qualifier sit in ONE cell (no horizontal rule between them in the raster), so they are transcribed as a single cell_value. Document page 33 carries only the footnote block and contributes no activity rows."
  },
